---
import { ArrowRight } from "lucide-astro";
---

<section
  id="vyuziti"
  class="py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-20 bg-white select-none"
  aria-labelledby="showcase-heading"
>
  <div class="max-w-[1260px] mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- LEFT COLUMN: All-caps bold stacked heading & copy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-start text-left">
        <h2
          id="showcase-heading"
          class="font-sans font-bold text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-[72px] text-[#2B2523] tracking-[-0.05em] uppercase leading-[0.9] mb-12"
        >
          OKAMŽITÁ<br />
          POMOC<br />
          NA JEDNO<br />
          STISKNUTÍ
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6 max-w-sm mb-10 text-left">
          <div>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-xs text-[#2B2523] block mb-1">
              Podržíte 2 s
            </span>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-[#2B2523] leading-[1.4] font-normal">
              Rozezní se hlasitá siréna a okamžitě se odesílají nouzové SMS zprávy.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="font-mono font-bold text-xs text-[#2B2523] block mb-1">
              Kliknete 2x
            </span>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-[#2B2523] leading-[1.4] font-normal">
              Nebezpečí pominulo nebo to byl omyl? Dvojitým stiskem poplach zrušíte.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="#jak-to-funguje"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-white bg-[#2B2523] hover:bg-black active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-sm"
        >
          <span>Jak to funguje</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT COLUMN: Figma Visual asset -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[780px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/figma-visual-4-14.png"
            alt="Okamžitá pomoc na jedno stisknutí - Vochránka tísňové tlačítko"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
            width="780"
            height="540"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
